scripts/larch-log.md:35:- `manifest` updates mutable manifest fields. Dotted keys `steps_ran.<step>` set per-step boolean flags under `.steps_ran` (shell step name after the dot; value must be `true` or `false`). Other keys use flat `field=value` syntax. Values that look like JSON-native scalars (`null`, `true`, `false`, integers) are passed via `--argjson` so they are stored with the correct JSON type; all other values are passed via `--arg` (stored as strings).
