scripts/test-merge-pr.md:3:**Purpose**: offline regression test for `scripts/merge-pr.sh`'s merge ordering, safety gates, same-version bump race gate, and `--no-admin-fallback` behavior.
scripts/test-merge-pr.md:9:1. Default mode with a successful `--admin` merge emits `MERGE_RESULT=admin_merged`, reads merge state and checks first, and does not invoke the plain fallback.
scripts/test-merge-pr.md:10:2. Default mode with a failing `--admin` merge retries a plain squash merge and emits `MERGE_RESULT=merged` when that fallback succeeds.
scripts/test-merge-pr.md:11:3. `--no-admin-fallback` uses the admin-eligible gate but invokes only the plain squash merge; a successful plain merge emits `MERGE_RESULT=merged`.
scripts/test-merge-pr.md:12:4. `--no-admin-fallback` with a failing plain merge emits `MERGE_RESULT=policy_denied` and preserves the stable policy-denial `ERROR` string.
scripts/test-merge-pr.md:42:- `gh pr merge ... --squash [--admin]` exits with `$GH_ADMIN_EXIT` / `$GH_PLAIN_EXIT` and emits `$GH_ADMIN_OUTPUT` / `$GH_PLAIN_OUTPUT`.
