   202	
   203	**Mode**: append (NDJSON records). **Written**: Step 2 (Q/A entries, progressive), Step 7a (pre-bump flush of `execution-issues.md`), later external-implementer / pre-push refreshes when new entries are added after Step 7a, and Step 18's safety net when the normal flush path was missed.
