1	in_scope	important	risk-integration	skills/design/SKILL.md:237-245 scripts/create-pr.sh:193-199	Plan publishes and admin-merges the current design branch as a log PR	/design can run on an existing user feature branch; create-pr.sh opens the PR from that current branch, so gh pr merge --admin can merge feature work immediately and --delete-branch can remove the branch /implement expects to continue on	Do not publish logs from CURRENT_BRANCH. Either defer design logs to the implementation PR, or create a dedicated log-only branch from the default branch, add only larch-logs/design/<RUN_ID>, merge that branch, then restore the original work branch without deleting it
